{"product_id":"diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-the-long-haul-book-9","title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid - the Long Haul (Book 9)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA family road trip is supposed to be a lot of fun . . . unless, of course, you re theHeffleys.The journey starts off full of promise, then quickly takes several wrong turns.Gas station bathrooms, crazed seagulls, a fender bender, and a runaway pig not exactly Greg Heffley s idea of a good time.But even the worst road trip can turn into an adventure and this is one the Heffleyswon t soon forget.\"\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 195\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeff Kinney\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141354224\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 236\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45347227828377,"sku":"10RC9780141354224","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/680f218f3eda9_Diary_of_a_Wimpy_Kid_-_the_Long_Haul__Book_9__Jeff_Kinney.jpg?v=1745914711","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-the-long-haul-book-9","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}